                <mxCell id="575" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;It need 8 ROM of 255x2 byte of data per each rom&amp;nbsp; total data is 255x2x8&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; which is more beneficial then implimenting of full GELU logic&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;we are trying to provide 8 lookup percycle so we need 8 similar rom&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
