                <mxCell id="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-627" value="&lt;p data-end=&quot;1141&quot; data-start=&quot;859&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;The designed TPU module accepts three input matrices &lt;strong data-end=&quot;917&quot; data-start=&quot;912&quot;&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-end=&quot;924&quot; data-start=&quot;919&quot;&gt;B&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-end=&quot;935&quot; data-start=&quot;930&quot;&gt;C&lt;/strong&gt;. Matrices &lt;strong data-end=&quot;951&quot; data-start=&quot;946&quot;&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-end=&quot;961&quot; data-start=&quot;956&quot;&gt;B&lt;/strong&gt; are multiplied using a parallel processing architecture, while matrix &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1037&quot; data-start=&quot;1032&quot;&gt;C&lt;/strong&gt; acts as a &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1061&quot; data-start=&quot;1048&quot;&gt;bias term&lt;/strong&gt; added to the multiplication result. The computation performed by the system is:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-display&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-mathml&quot;&gt;&lt;math display=&quot;block&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;Y&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;A&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;×&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;B&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;+&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;C&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;Y = A \times B + C&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mrel&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mbin&quot;&gt;×&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mbin&quot;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1350&quot; data-start=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;The resulting matrix &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1205&quot; data-start=&quot;1200&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/strong&gt; is quantized and stored as &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1254&quot; data-start=&quot;1233&quot;&gt;8-bit output data&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing efficient computation and optimized memory bandwidth in the accelerator architecture&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-1240" y="-2660" width="2790" height="630" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-628" value="" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-2300" y="-1800" width="1540" height="800" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-629" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;The module operates using a &lt;strong data-end=&quot;643&quot; data-start=&quot;611&quot;&gt;streaming dataflow mechanism&lt;/strong&gt;, where input data is supplied sequentially. The &lt;strong data-end=&quot;761&quot; data-start=&quot;692&quot;&gt;rightmost column of the input matrix is fed into the system first&lt;/strong&gt;, and the &lt;strong data-end=&quot;856&quot; data-start=&quot;771&quot;&gt;output results are produced in the same order, starting from the rightmost column&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-2215" y="-1720" width="1370" height="460" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-630" value="Text" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-2150" y="-500" width="260" height="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-631" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 200px;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-1910" y="180" width="260" height="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-632" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 200px;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="460" y="-960" width="260" height="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-633" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 200px;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-625" y="-960" width="260" height="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-634" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 200px;&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="5590" y="615" width="260" height="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-635" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;this is shifter which delays the input&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-460" y="960" width="420" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-639" style="edgeStyle=none;shape=flexArrow;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.967;entryY=0.004;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;fillColor=#000000;" parent="1" source="Ub5wa7rxOkETr6co5OkR-591" target="353" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <Array as="points">
                            <mxPoint x="-1060" y="-760"/>
