                <mxCell id="KPPFCMnJmA1Y3M6_qub_-3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 72px;&quot;&gt;THIS IS THE INTERFACE WITH DMA ENGINE AND CONTROLE BLOCK&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;THE DATA THAT FLOWS&amp;nbsp; TO THE BUFFER IS&amp;nbsp; SERIAL TRANSFER&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;WITH BUS WIDTH == DATA WIDTH&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;LIKE OUTPUT BUSE&amp;nbsp; IS 1 BYTE WEIGHT IS 1 BYTE&amp;nbsp; ACTIVATION IS 1 BYTE&amp;nbsp; AND BIAS IS 4 BYTE&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
